218.3,93.6 220.8,97.3 223.3,100.8 225.9,104.2 228.4,107.3 230.9,110.2 233.5,112.8 236.0,115.3 238.5,117.6 241.1,119.6 243.6,121.5 246.1,123.2 248.7,124.7 251.2,126.1 253.7,127.3 256.3,128.4 258.8,129.3 261.3,130.2 263.9,130.9 266.4,131.5 268.9,132.1 271.5,132.5 274.0,132.9 276.5,133.3 279.1,133.6 281.6,133.8 284.1,134.0 286.7,134.2 289.2,134.4 291.7,134.5 294.3,134.6 296.8,134.7 299.3,134.7 301.9,134.8 304.4,134.8 306.9,134.9 309.5,134.9 312.0,134.9' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='4.0' y1='135.0' x2='316.0' y2='135.0' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='81.6' y1='139.0' x2='81.6' y2='117.5' stroke='#6d4ae0' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='3 2'/><text x='81.6' y='152.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10.5' font-weight='700' fill='#6d4ae0'>−z<tspan font-size='8' dy='3'>1−α/2</tspan></text><line x1='238.4' y1='139.0' x2='238.4' y2='117.5' stroke='#6d4ae0' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='3 2'/><text x='238.4' y='152.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10.5' font-weight='700' fill='#6d4ae0'>z<tspan font-size='8' dy='3'>1−α/2</tspan></text><text x='238.4' y='165.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10.5' font-weight='700' fill='#6d4ae0'>= 1,96</text><text x='160.0' y='87.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='700'>1 − α = 0,95</text><line x1='71.6' y1='130.3' x2='36.0' y2='105.0' stroke='#c2185b' stroke-width='1'/><text x='8.0' y='102.0' text-anchor='start' font-size='10' fill='#c2185b'>α/2 = 0,025</text><line x1='248.4' y1='130.3' x2='284.0' y2='105.0' stroke='#c2185b' stroke-width='1'/><text x='312.0' y='102.0' text-anchor='end' font-size='10' fill='#c2185b'>α/2 = 0,025</text><text x='160.0' y='148.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9.5'>0</text></svg></div><p>La amplitud es \\(2E\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>El intervalo va de \\(\\bar x-E\\) a \\(\\bar x+E\\): su longitud es \\(2E\\).</i>, así que</p>\\[2E=0{,}0784\\Rightarrow E=0{,}0392\\]<p>Despejamos \\(n\\) de la fórmula del error:</p>\\[E=z_{1-\\alpha/2}\\cdot\\frac\\sigma{\\sqrt n}\\Rightarrow\\sqrt n=\\frac{z_{1-\\alpha/2}\\cdot\\sigma}{E}=\\frac{1{,}96\\cdot0{,}1}{0{,}0392}=5\\Rightarrow n=25\\]<div class='res'>La muestra tenía \\(n=25\\) tornillos</div><p><b>Conclusión:</b> con una confianza del 95 % y \\(\\sigma=0{,}1\\) cm, un intervalo de amplitud 0,0784 cm corresponde a una muestra de 25 tornillos.</p></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El intervalo está centrado en la media muestral y su semiamplitud es el error, \\(E=0{,}0392\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>\\(IC=(\\bar x-E,\\ \\bar x+E)\\): al sumar los extremos se anula \\(E\\), y al restarlos se anula \\(\\bar x\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\bar x-E=1{,}75-0{,}0392=1{,}7108\\]\\[\\bar x+E=1{,}75+0{,}0392=1{,}7892\\]<div class='res'>\\(IC_{0{,}95}(\\mu)=(1{,}7108;\\ 1{,}7892)\\) cm</div><p><b>Conclusión:</b> podemos afirmar, con un nivel de confianza del 95 %, que la longitud media de los tornillos se encuentra entre 1,7108 y 1,7892 cm.</p></div>"
    }
   ],
