  {
   "id": "ccss-2005-reserva-4-b1",
   "n": "B1",
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "3",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea el sistema de inecuaciones siguiente: \\(x+y\\le600\\), \\(x\\le500\\), \\(y\\le3x\\), \\(x\\ge0\\), \\(y\\ge0\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(2 puntos) Represente gráficamente el conjunto de soluciones del sistema y calcule sus vértices.",
     "(1 punto) Halle el punto del recinto anterior en el que la función \\(F(x,y)=38x+27y\\) alcanza su valor máximo."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Tablas de valores de las rectas frontera:</p><table class='tb'><tr><th colspan='3'>\\(x+y=600\\)</th></tr><tr><th>\\(x\\)</th><td>\\(0\\)</td><td>\\(600\\)</td></tr><tr><th>\\(y\\)</th><td>\\(600\\)</td><td>\\(0\\)</td></tr></table><table class='tb'><tr><th colspan='3'>\\(-3x+y=0\\)</th></tr><tr><th>\\(x\\)</th><td>\\(0\\)</td><td>\\(150\\)</td></tr><tr><th>\\(y\\)</th><td>\\(0\\)</td><td>\\(450\\)</td></tr></table><p>\\(x=500\\) es una recta vertical, paralela al eje de ordenadas.</p><p>Para elegir cada semiplano probamos un punto que no esté en la recta, normalmente el origen<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si el punto cumple la inecuación, el semiplano solución es el que lo contiene; si no la cumple, es el otro.</i>:</p><ul><li>\\(x+y\\le600\\): con el origen, \\(0\\le600\\) se cumple → semiplano que lo contiene.</li><li>\\(x\\le500\\): con el origen, \\(0\\le500\\) se cumple → semiplano que lo contiene.</li><li>\\(-3x+y\\le0\\): con el punto \\((1,0)\\), \\(-3\\le0\\) se cumple → semiplano que lo contiene.</li></ul><p>Además, \\(x\\ge0\\) y \\(y\\ge0\\) limitan la región al primer cuadrante.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 420 300' width='100%' style='max-width:420px' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' font-family='sans-serif'><line x1='48.9' y1='266.0' x2='48.9' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='98.5' y1='266.0' x2='98.5' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='148.0' y1='266.0' x2='148.0' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='197.6' y1='266.0' x2='197.6' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='247.2' y1='266.0' x2='247.2' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='296.8' y1='266.0' x2='296.8' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='346.3' y1='266.0' x2='346.3' y2='34.0' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='255.8' x2='386.0' y2='255.8' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='221.6' x2='386.0' y2='221.6' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='187.5' x2='386.0' y2='187.5' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='153.4' x2='386.0' y2='153.4' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='119.3' x2='386.0' y2='119.3' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='85.2' x2='386.0' y2='85.2' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='51.1' x2='386.0' y2='51.1' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='255.8' x2='386.0' y2='255.8' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='48.9' y1='266.0' x2='48.9' y2='34.0' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.3'/><text x='98.5' y='268.8' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>100</text><text x='148.0' y='268.8' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>200</text><text x='197.6' y='268.8' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>300</text><text x='247.2' y='268.8' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>400</text><text x='296.8' y='268.8' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>500</text><text x='346.3' y='268.8' font-size='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#374151'>600</text><text x='44.9' y='224.6' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>100</text><text x='44.9' y='190.5' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>200</text><text x='44.9' y='156.4' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>300</text><text x='44.9' y='122.3' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>400</text><text x='44.9' y='88.2' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>500</text><text x='44.9' y='54.1' font-size='10' text-anchor='end' fill='#374151'>600</text><text x='384.0' y='250.8' font-size='11' text-anchor='end' font-style='italic'>x</text><text x='53.9' y='44.0' font-size='11' font-style='italic'>y</text><polygon points='48.9,255.8 296.8,255.8 296.8,221.6 123.2,102.2' fill='#fcd34d' fill-opacity='0.55' stroke='none'/><line x1='34.0' y1='40.8' x2='361.2' y2='266.0' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='2'/><text x='71.7' y='58.3' font-size='10' fill='#b45309' text-anchor='start'>x+y=600</text><line x1='296.8' y1='266.0' x2='296.8' y2='34.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='291.8' y='52.2' font-size='10' fill='#2563eb' text-anchor='end'>x=500</text><line x1='43.9' y1='266.0' x2='156.3' y2='34.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2'/><text x='82.6' y='191.4' font-size='10' fill='#16a34a' text-anchor='start'>y = 3x</text><text x='197.6' y='199.4' font-size='15' fill='#92400e' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>R</text><circle cx='48.9' cy='255.8' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='41.9' y='270.8' font-size='12' fill='#111' text-anchor='end' font-weight='bold'>O</text><circle cx='296.8' cy='255.8' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='303.8' y='270.8' font-size='12' fill='#111' text-anchor='start' font-weight='bold'>A</text><circle cx='296.8' cy='221.6' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='303.8' y='236.6' font-size='12' fill='#111' text-anchor='start' font-weight='bold'>B</text><circle cx='123.2' cy='102.2' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='116.2' y='95.2' font-size='12' fill='#111' text-anchor='end' font-weight='bold'>C</text></svg></div><p>La condición \\(x\\ge0\\) no aporta ningún lado<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si \\(y\\ge0\\) e \\(y\\le3x\\), entonces \\(3x\\ge0\\), es decir, \\(x\\ge0\\).</i>.</p><p>Hallamos sus vértices:</p><ul><li>\\(O:\\;\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x=0\\\\y=0\\end{array}\\right.\\) \\(\\Rightarrow \\boxed{O(0,0)}\\)</li><li>\\(A:\\;\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x=500\\\\y=0\\end{array}\\right.\\) \\(\\Rightarrow \\boxed{A(500,0)}\\)</li><li>\\(B:\\;\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x+y=600\\\\x=500\\end{array}\\right.\\) \\(\\Rightarrow y=100\\) \\(\\Rightarrow \\boxed{B(500,100)}\\)</li><li>\\(C:\\;\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x+y=600\\\\-3x+y=0\\end{array}\\right.\\) \\(\\Rightarrow y=-x+600\\) \\(\\Rightarrow -3x+(-x+600)=0\\) \\(\\Rightarrow x=150,\\ y=450\\) \\(\\Rightarrow \\boxed{C(150,450)}\\)</li></ul><div class='res'>El recinto es el cuadrilátero de vértices \\(O(0,0)\\), \\(A(500,0)\\), \\(B(500,100)\\) y \\(C(150,450)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La función \\(F\\) alcanza sus extremos en el recinto, en puntos de su frontera; evaluamos, por tanto, \\(F\\) en los vértices<i class='n' data-t='th'>Teorema fundamental de la programación lineal: si la región factible es un polígono convexo y acotado, la función objetivo alcanza su máximo y su mínimo en alguno de sus vértices.</i>:</p>\\[F(O)=F(0,0)=38\\cdot0+27\\cdot0=0\\]\\[F(A)=F(500,0)=38\\cdot500+27\\cdot0=19\\,000\\]\\[F(B)=F(500,100)=38\\cdot500+27\\cdot100=21\\,700\\]\\[F(C)=F(150,450)=38\\cdot150+27\\cdot450=17\\,850\\]<p>\\(F\\) alcanza un máximo en \\(B(500,100)\\) de valor \\(21\\,700\\).</p><div class='res'>El máximo es 21 700, en el punto \\((500,100)\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
