1,109.1 322.0,108.0 322.9,107.0 323.7,105.9 324.6,104.8 325.5,103.8 326.3,102.7 327.2,101.6 328.1,100.6 328.9,99.5 329.8,98.4 330.7,97.3 331.5,96.3 332.4,95.2 333.3,94.1 334.1,93.1 335.0,92.0 335.9,90.9 336.7,89.9 337.6,88.8 338.5,87.7 339.3,86.7 340.2,85.6 341.1,84.5 341.9,83.4 342.8,82.4 343.7,81.3 344.5,80.2 345.4,79.2 346.3,78.1 347.1,77.0 348.0,76.0 348.9,74.9 349.7,73.8 350.6,72.7 351.5,71.7 352.3,70.6 353.2,69.5 354.1,68.5 354.9,67.4 355.8,66.3 356.7,65.3 357.5,64.2 358.4,63.1 359.3,62.1 360.1,61.0 361.0,59.9 361.9,58.8 362.7,57.8 363.6,56.7 364.5,55.6 365.3,54.6 366.2,53.5 367.1,52.4 367.9,51.4 368.8,50.3 369.7,49.2 370.5,48.2 371.4,47.1 372.3,46.0 373.1,44.9 374.0,43.9' fill='none' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><circle cx='110.0' cy='172.2' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='190.0' cy='122.9' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='270.0' cy='172.2' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='350.0' cy='73.5' r='3.6' fill='#111' stroke='#111' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='68.0' y='166.2' font-size='10' fill='#111' text-anchor='start' font-weight='bold'>(0, 0)</text><text x='176.0' y='114.9' font-size='10' fill='#111' text-anchor='start' font-weight='bold'>(2, 2)</text><text x='264.0' y='188.2' font-size='10' fill='#111' text-anchor='start' font-weight='bold'>(4, 0)</text><text x='310.0' y='69.5' font-size='10' fill='#111' text-anchor='start' font-weight='bold'>(6, 4)</text></svg></div><p><b>Monotonía y extremos.</b> A la vista de la gráfica (y lo comprobamos con la derivada):</p><p>Por el apartado a, el único punto «problemático» es \\(x=4\\), donde \\(f\\) es continua pero no derivable.</p><p>Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=\\begin{cases}2-x&\\text{si }x\\lt4\\\\ 2&\\text{si }x\\gt4\\end{cases}\\]\\[2-x=0\\Rightarrow\\boxed{x=2}\\qquad 2\\neq0\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 274 108' width='100%' style='max-width:329px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H260' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>4</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M43.0 40L79.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 11L79.0 10L77.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1) &gt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(3) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M207.0 40L243.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 11L243.0 10L241.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(5) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(f\\) crece en \\((-\\infty,2)\\) y \\((4,+\\infty)\\) y decrece en \\((2,4)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>.</p><p>Alcanza un máximo en \\(x=2\\) de valor \\(f(2)=2\\) y un mínimo en \\(x=4\\) de valor \\(f(4)=0\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>.</p><p>En \\(x=4\\) hay un mínimo aunque \\(f\\) no sea derivable<i class='n' data-t='why'>\\(f\\) es continua en \\(x=4\\) y pasa de decrecer a crecer. En ese punto la gráfica tiene un pico.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Crece en \\((-\\infty,2)\\) y en \\((4,+\\infty)\\) y decrece en \\((2,4)\\); máximo relativo en \\((2,2)\\) y mínimo relativo en \\((4,0)\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
